
==============================================================================
S673 Borel antidiagonalization and constructive embedded maximality
==============================================================================
HYP-2248 / T743.
Working synthesis: diagonalization is constructive only after the diagonal address is embedded; incompleteness becomes tangible when a finite-looking extension law asks for a uniform bound beyond the local quotient.

