==============================================================================
Repo transfer notes
==============================================================================
HYP-2242: embedded maximality names the ambient extension before calling something maximal.
HYP-2243: outer-extension usability says a quotient is useful only if its retained address keeps target fibers pure under growth.
HYP-2247/T742: recursion is the transition law; constructive witness extraction asks whether that transition is programmatic.
LRC14 next move: define diagonal/cut addresses for the C=27 owner-carry fiber, then prove the local rank drop constructively rather than by post-hoc classification.
A000568 next move: pair the half-filter deck with a constructive child selection rule; without selection, purity can be true but unusable.
Unit distance next move: treat a unit-spine owner as the diagonal address; bulk edge counts alone are row/column weights.
